      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ごめんね。\r\nでも、話すことはできないの。\r\nこれは私とレイン……二人だけの秘密だから。",
        "official_en": "Sorry, but I’m not at liberty to say. It’s a secret...just between Rain and I.",
        "real_en": "Sorry, but I can’t tell you. It’s a secret between Rain and me... just the two of us."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
